stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Queued : Job submitted

    Queued --> Running : Executor picks up job
    Queued --> Cancelled : User cancels before execution

    Running --> GateLocked : Gate evaluation fails
    Running --> Failed : Execution error (LLM timeout, OOM, etc)
    Running --> Completed : All phases + gates pass

    GateLocked --> Running : Manual gate override (admin)
    GateLocked --> Failed : Max retry attempts exceeded
    GateLocked --> Cancelled : User aborts

    Failed --> Retrying : Transient error, retry policy active
    Retrying --> Running : Retry attempt
    Retrying --> Failed : Max retries exceeded

    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]

    note right of Running
        Phases: 0 → 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5 → 6
        Each phase has gate evaluation
    end note

    note right of GateLocked
        Gate conditions failed:
        - Counter-check failure
        - Missing artifacts
        - Schema validation error
        Requires human review or fix
    end note

    note right of Failed
        Failure reasons:
        - LLM API timeout
        - Out of memory
        - Invalid workflow.md
        - Unhandled exception
    end note

    note right of Completed
        All artifacts persisted:
        - context-assessment.yaml
        - canonical-operations.yaml
        - architecture-model.yaml
        - verification-report.yaml
    end note
